BT /F2 13 Tf 60 700 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 674 Td (This document sets the standards examiners apply to the parallel parking manoeuvre on) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 659 Td (the Northfield test circuit. Candidates should practise the manoeuvre until it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 644 Td (smooth and controlled.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 60 617 Td (2. Approach) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 591 Td (Drive towards the parking bay at a steady speed. Approach the parked car at no more) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 576 Td (than 20 km/h.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 557 Td (Switch on the left indicator before you stop alongside the parked car.) Tj ET
