BT /F1 11 Tf 60 523 Td (from it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 60 496 Td (3. Reversing into the bay) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 470 Td (Select reverse gear and check all round, looking over both shoulders before you move.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 451 Td (Reverse at walking pace. Your speed must not exceed 4 km/h while reversing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 432 Td (Do not reverse more than 10 m from where you stopped alongside the parked car.) Tj ET
